<title>CHILE: Chile's Masisa 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Chile's Masisa 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean forestry company Maderas y Sinteticos SA (Masisa) reported the following results for 1996.</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>Net earnings		   6.97		 9.42</p>
<p>Operating profit	     3.72		 6.92</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	 3.77		 2.89</p>
<p>Net revenues		  41.19		42.83</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
